# Yggdrasil overlay patch series
#
# Per OS-FORK-DISCIPLINE.md §"Pillar 2 — Overlay patch format", every
# divergence from upstream Debian is a numbered, headed, reviewed patch
# applied via `quilt push -a`. This file lists patches in apply order.
#
# Format: NNNN-short-description.patch (one per line, in numeric order).
# Sample patches authored 2026-05-11 to illustrate the discipline shape.
# Phase 1 (task #65) replaces these with the full CIS-mapped overlay set.
#
# Discipline gates (per OS-FORK-DISCIPLINE.md §8 + §"Pillar 4 — Divergence budget"):
#   - patch count <= 50
#   - total LOC delta <= 5,000
#   - no upstream file with > 3 patches against it
#   - every patch has SPDX + Subject/Reason/Upstream-status/Authored headers

